# PrimeLayer Admin Panel

Follow these rules on every prompt. Do not ask the user to repeat them. Do not restate them in replies.

## Architecture
- Feature-first clean architecture.
- New screen = `lib/features/<name>/{data,domain,presentation}`.
- Shared code only in `lib/core/`.
- Copy existing files. Do not invent new patterns.

## Must
- State: Cubit or Bloc only. Never `setState`.
- Routes: add to `lib/core/router/app_router.dart` and `route_names.dart`. Never `Navigator.push`.
- Theme/fonts/colors: `lib/core/theme/` only. Never hardcode in widgets.
- Responsive: `Responsive` helper or `responsive_framework`. Never raw width checks scattered in UI.
- Imports: `package:primelayer_admin_panel/...` only. Never `../` or `./`.
- Max 300 lines per file. Split if larger.
- Keep it simple. No extra layers, packages, or abstractions unless required.

## Agent output
- Do the task only. Short replies. No README/docs/comments unless asked.
- Prefer edit over new files. Do not duplicate code.
